  "content": "\n<p>Materi Pengenalan Google Collabs</p>\n<p>Langkah-langkah</p>\n<ol>\n  <li>Buka Google Colab Buka aplikasi melalui link <a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://colab.research.google.com/</a>. Jika diminta untuk sign-in,\n    silakan masuk menggunakan akun Google/Gmail kamu.</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n<p></p>\n<media-image source=\"files/collabs.jpg\" card accent-color=\"grey\" size=\"wide\" offset=\"none\" caption=\"Tampilan baru google Collabs\" citation=\"Informatika Kelas X\" modal-title=\"Tampilan baru google Collabs\" _has-caption></media-image>\n<p></p>\n<p>2. Cek Lingkungan IDE</p>\n<p>pilih New Notebook untuk membuat catatan baru</p>\n<p>3.&#160;Ketikan perintah print (&#8220;Hello World&#8221;) di area kerja editor\n  Google Colab, kemudian jalankan program dengan menekan tombol segitiga di kiri kode\n  program</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n  <latihan-kuis duration=\"300\" judul-materi=\"Materi Pembelajaran\" teks-materi=\"Baca materi di bawah ini dengan saksama sebelum mengerjakan kuis. Waktu pengerjaan kuis dibatasi oleh timer; saat waktu habis, kuis akan dikunci dan nilai otomatis terkirim.\" materi-file=\"\" cover-image=\"\" judul-kuis=\"Evaluasi Kuis Interaktif\" student-id=\"\" student-name=\"\" student-nis=\"\" student-absen=\"\" student-kelas=\"\" kd-materi=\"\" pesan-waktu-habis=\"⏰ Waktu habis! Kuis dikunci &amp; dinilai otomatis.\" pesan-nilai-terkirim=\"🎉 Selamat! Nilai Anda sudah terkirim ke spreadsheet.\" label-mulai=\"▶️ Mulai\" allow-retake max-retake=\"0\" mode=\"siswa\" hide-pause-restart kategori=\"sumatif_lm\" show-question-nav question-delay=\"1800\" review-answers timer-autostart kkm=\"75\" tab-switch-threshold=\"3\" _attempt-ke=\"0\" _remidi-soal=\"[]\" _tab-switch-count=\"0\" _visibility-change-count=\"0\" _window-blur-count=\"0\" _window-focus-count=\"0\" _warning-count=\"0\"     ></latihan-kuis>\n\n\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<kuis-ledakan questions=\"[{&quot;q&quot;:&quot;Apa kegunaan utama metode connectedCallback pada LitElement?&quot;,&quot;a&quot;:&quot;Menginisialisasi nilai variabel dasar&quot;,&quot;b&quot;:&quot;Mendeteksi elemen saat berhasil diinjeksikan ke struktur DOM&quot;,&quot;c&quot;:&quot;Menghapus event listener global&quot;,&quot;k&quot;:&quot;b&quot;},{&quot;q&quot;:&quot;Bagaimana cara mencegah timeout 6 menit pada Google Apps Script?&quot;,&quot;a&quot;:&quot;Menggunakan penulisan masal berbasis batch I/O&quot;,&quot;b&quot;:&quot;Menulis ke banyak sheet terpisah&quot;,&quot;c&quot;:&quot;Memperbanyak rumus formula cell&quot;,&quot;k&quot;:&quot;a&quot;}]\" judul=\"Latihan Soal\" kd-materi=\"Pertemuan 1\" kategori=\"formatif\" mode=\"siswa\" lock-after-complete show-question-nav question-delay=\"1800\" review-answers student-id=\"\" student-name=\"\" student-nis=\"\" student-absen=\"\" student-kelas=\"\" timer-duration=\"0\" timer-autostart timer-minutes=\"0\" timer-seconds=\"0\" hide-pause-restart _attempt-start=\"0\" _resume-remaining=\"0\" _current-idx=\"0\" _selected-answers=\"{}\" _match-answers=\"{}\" _answered-set=\"{}\" _user-answers=\"{}\" _max-points=\"0\" _shuffled-questions=\"[]\" _temp-questions=\"[]\" _editing-index=\"-1\" _temp-question-type=\"mc\" _temp-question-points=\"1\" _temp-correct-index=\"0\" _temp-correct-answers=\"[]\" _temp-left-items=\"[&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;]\" _temp-right-items=\"[&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;]\" _temp-correct-pairs=\"{}\" _temp-accepted-statements=\"[]\" _temp-statements=\"[]\" _editor-origin=\"result\" ></kuis-ledakan>\n"
